{"version":1,"content":"<p>秋風起，又到大閘蟹當造季節。</p><p>不少酒家、食肆均推出大閘蟹放題或蟹宴套餐。</p><p>市民選購和食用大閘蟹時有什麼細節需要留意？</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:57.577473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T00:58:44.418401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:12.862588+00:00","content_hash":"4025ada04a29b792304d9d0c5d80bc04171ca51113f9fe6c717ba8511807fc3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}